    "IP uses standard DNS. DNS over HTTPS (DoH), TLS (DoT), and QUIC (DoQ) encrypt allowed lookups to the resolver.": "IP utilise le DNS standard, non chiffré. DoH (DNS over HTTPS), DoT (DNS over TLS) et DoQ (DNS over QUIC) chiffrent les requêtes entre Lava et votre fournisseur DNS.",
