    "IP uses standard, unencrypted DNS. DoH (DNS over HTTPS) and DoT (DNS over TLS) encrypt lookups between Lava and your DNS provider.": "IP utilise le DNS standard, non chiffré. DoH (DNS over HTTPS) et DoT (DNS over TLS) chiffrent les requêtes entre Lava et votre fournisseur DNS.",
