    "IP uses standard DNS. DNS over HTTPS (DoH), TLS (DoT), and QUIC (DoQ) encrypt allowed lookups to the resolver.": "IP 使用标准的未加密 DNS。DoH（DNS over HTTPS）、DoT（DNS over TLS）和 DoQ（DNS over QUIC）会加密 Lava 与你的 DNS 提供商之间的请求。",
