    "A link can show one name but open another. Check where it really goes before you tap.": "链接显示的名称可能和实际打开的网址不同。轻点前先确认它真正的去向。",
    "Switch on a blocklist once and Lava keeps catching those domains for you.": "开启一次拦截列表，Lava 就会持续为你拦截那些域名。",
