    "Your primary DNS is %@. The DNS profile status is unavailable. For more details, check DNS settings.": "你的主 DNS 是 %@。目前无法获取系统 DNS 描述文件的状态。更多详情请查看 DNS 设置。",
    "It all starts here, on your device. Before it opens anything, it asks one question: where does this website live?": "一切都从这里开始，就在你的设备上。打开任何内容前，它会先问一个问题：这个网站在哪里？",
    "Then, if VPN chaining is on, your request travels through your VPN on its way to DNS.": "接着，如果 VPN 串联已开启，请求会先经过你的 VPN，再前往 DNS。",
    "And last comes DNS. You get to choose who answers your device’s questions.": "最后一站是 DNS。你可以自己选择由谁来回答设备的问题。",
    "This time, your filter sees that this website is allowed and lets the request continue.": "这一次，筛选器发现这个网站已被允许，就让请求继续前进。",
    "From here, the request travels through your VPN if chaining is on, then heads to DNS.": "接下来，如果串联已开启，请求会先经过你的 VPN，再前往 DNS。",
    "Every request takes a journey along the path you set. Let’s look at each step.": "每个请求都会沿着你设置的路径走一趟。一起来看看每个步骤吧。",
    "First comes your filter. It checks each request against your lists, then lets it through or stops it here.": "首先是你的筛选器。它会对照你的列表检查每个请求，再决定放行，还是在这里拦下。",
    "Let’s try a website you’ve blocked. First, your device sends the request to your filter.": "我们来试试一个你拦截的网站。首先，设备会把请求发给你的筛选器。",
    "Your filter sees that this website is blocked and stops the request right here. It never reaches DNS.": "筛选器发现这个网站已被拦截，就在这里拦下请求，DNS 完全不会收到。",
    "Now let’s try a website you’ve allowed. The request goes to your filter, just like before.": "现在，我们来试试一个你允许的网站。请求和刚才一样，先到你的筛选器。",
    "DNS finds the website’s address and sends it back, so your device knows where to connect.": "DNS 找到网站的地址并传回来，你的设备就知道该连接到哪里了。",
    "That’s the whole journey. Now it’s your turn: tap a step to take a closer look.": "这就是整个过程。现在轮到你了：轻点任一步骤，仔细看看。",
    "Waiting to reconnect": "等待重新连接",
    "Lava will reconnect automatically.": "Lava 会自动重新连接。",
