    "Filtering is on using encrypted backup DNS.": "防护中，正在使用你的加密备用 DNS。",
    "That question goes to DNS, the internet’s address book. It matches each website name to its address.": "这个问题会交给 DNS，也就是互联网的通讯录。它能把每个网站名称对应到地址。",
    "Get a WireGuard config from your VPN provider.": "从 VPN 提供商获取 WireGuard 配置。",
