    "Remove configuration?": "移除配置？",
    "The remaining configuration will become the only VPN hop. Guard reconnects if chaining is on.": "剩余配置将成为唯一的 VPN 节点。如果已启用串联，Guard 会重新连接。",
    "This deletes its saved keys and turns VPN chaining off.": "这将删除已保存的密钥并关闭 VPN 串联。",
    "You can add up to two WireGuard configurations.": "最多可添加两个 WireGuard 配置。",
    "The second configuration needs an IPv4 endpoint address.": "第二个配置需要 IPv4 端点地址。",
    "The first configuration's AllowedIPs must include the second VPN's endpoint.": "第一个配置的 AllowedIPs 必须包含第二个 VPN 的端点。",
    "The first configuration's MTU must be at least 1340 for two VPN hops.": "使用两个 VPN 节点时，第一个配置的 MTU 必须至少为 1340。",
