    "Scan to import my Lava filter": "掃描以匯入我的 Lava 篩選器",
    "Set up on this device. Your online backup is pending.": "已在這台裝置設定完成。線上備份尚未完成。",
    "Share": "分享",
    "Single domain": "單一網域",
    "Some domains were invalid or cannot be allowed.": "部分網域無效或無法允許。",
    "System DNS": "系統 DNS",
    "The selected filter keeps its name. Review the content changes below.": "所選篩選器的名稱保持不變。請檢閱下方的內容變更。",
    "This changes the filter protecting this device. “%@” keeps its name and receives the reviewed content.": "這會變更你使用中的篩選器。「%@」的名稱保持不變，並套用已檢閱的內容。",
    "This filter cannot be shared.": "無法分享此篩選器。",
    "This removes saved network activity entries from this device. Filtering counts and domain history are unchanged.": "這會從這台裝置移除已儲存的網路活動項目。篩選計數與網域記錄不會變動。",
    "Unlock this device and reopen Lava to read its security settings.": "請解鎖這台裝置並重新開啟 Lava，以讀取安全設定。",
    "Use public source URLs without private parameters before sharing.": "分享前，請使用不含私人參數的公開封鎖清單網址。",
    "View or edit": "檢視或編輯",
    "Your draft library changes won't be applied.": "不會套用篩選器庫的草稿變更。",
    "Your filter is shared as-is. Review your blocklists, blocked sites, and allowed exceptions before sharing. Anyone with the code can see them.": "你的篩選器將原樣分享。分享前，請檢閱你的封鎖清單、已封鎖的網域及允許的例外。任何持有設定代碼的人都能看到這些內容。",
    "Your filters changed or could not be saved. Close Review and check your changes before trying again.": "篩選器已變更或無法儲存。請關閉檢閱畫面，確認變更後再試。",
    "This device starts the request.": "這台裝置會發起請求。",
    "You're currently using the %@ filter, with %@.": "你目前使用的是 %@ 篩選器，共 %@。",
    "You're currently using the %@ filter.": "你目前使用的是 %@ 篩選器。",
    "Your active filter is unavailable.": "目前的篩選器無法使用。",
    "Your primary DNS is %@. For more details, check DNS settings.": "你的主要 DNS 是 %@。更多詳細資訊請查看 DNS 設定。",
    "Your primary DNS is %@. The DNS profile is active. For more details, check DNS settings.": "你的主要 DNS 是 %@。系統 DNS 描述檔已開啟。更多詳細資訊請查看 DNS 設定。",
    "Your primary DNS is %@. The DNS profile is inactive. For more details, check DNS settings.": "你的主要 DNS 是 %@。系統 DNS 描述檔已關閉。更多詳細資訊請查看 DNS 設定。",
    "Your primary DNS is %@. The DNS profile status is unavailable. For more details, check DNS settings.": "你的主要 DNS 是 %@。目前無法取得系統 DNS 描述檔的狀態。更多詳細資訊請查看 DNS 設定。",
    "It all starts here, on your device. Before it opens anything, it asks one question: where does this website live?": "一切都從這裡開始，就在你的裝置上。開啟任何內容前，它會先問一個問題：這個網站在哪裡？",
    "Then, if VPN chaining is on, your request travels through your VPN on its way to DNS.": "接著，如果 VPN 串接已開啟，請求會先經過你的 VPN，再前往 DNS。",
    "And last comes DNS. You get to choose who answers your device’s questions.": "最後一站是 DNS。你可以自己選擇由誰來回答裝置的問題。",
    "This time, your filter sees that this website is allowed and lets the request continue.": "這一次，篩選器發現這個網站已被允許，就讓請求繼續前進。",
    "From here, the request travels through your VPN if chaining is on, then heads to DNS.": "接下來，如果串接已開啟，請求會先經過你的 VPN，再前往 DNS。",
    "Every request takes a journey along the path you set. Let’s look at each step.": "每個請求都會沿著你設定的路徑走一趟。一起來看看每個步驟吧。",
    "First comes your filter. It checks each request against your lists, then lets it through or stops it here.": "首先是你的篩選器。它會對照你的清單檢查每個請求，再決定放行，還是在這裡擋下。",
    "Let’s try a website you’ve blocked. First, your device sends the request to your filter.": "我們來試試一個你封鎖的網站。首先，裝置會把請求傳給你的篩選器。",
    "Your filter sees that this website is blocked and stops the request right here. It never reaches DNS.": "篩選器發現這個網站已被封鎖，就在這裡擋下請求，DNS 完全不會收到。",
    "Now let’s try a website you’ve allowed. The request goes to your filter, just like before.": "現在，我們來試試一個你允許的網站。請求和剛才一樣，先到你的篩選器。",
    "DNS finds the website’s address and sends it back, so your device knows where to connect.": "DNS 找到網站的位址並傳回來，你的裝置就知道該連線到哪裡了。",
    "That’s the whole journey. Now it’s your turn: tap a step to take a closer look.": "這就是整個過程。現在換你了：點一下任一步驟，仔細看看。",
    "Waiting to reconnect": "等待重新連線",
    "Lava will reconnect automatically.": "Lava 會自動重新連線。",
