    "Filtering is on using encrypted backup DNS.": "防護中，正在使用你的加密備援 DNS。",
    "That question goes to DNS, the internet’s address book. It matches each website name to its address.": "這個問題會交給 DNS，也就是網際網路的通訊錄。它能把每個網站名稱對應到位址。",
    "Get a WireGuard config from your VPN provider.": "向 VPN 供應商取得 WireGuard 設定。",
