    "Remove configuration?": "移除設定？",
    "The remaining configuration will become the only VPN hop. Guard reconnects if chaining is on.": "剩餘設定將成為唯一的 VPN 節點。若已啟用串接，Guard 會重新連線。",
    "This deletes its saved keys and turns VPN chaining off.": "這會刪除已儲存的金鑰並關閉 VPN 串接。",
    "You can add up to two WireGuard configurations.": "最多可加入兩個 WireGuard 設定。",
    "The second configuration needs an IPv4 endpoint address.": "第二個設定需要 IPv4 端點位址。",
