    "IP uses standard DNS. DNS over HTTPS (DoH), TLS (DoT), and QUIC (DoQ) encrypt allowed lookups to the resolver.": "IP usa il DNS standard non cifrato. DoH (DNS over HTTPS), DoT (DNS over TLS) e DoQ (DNS over QUIC) cifrano le richieste tra Lava e il tuo provider DNS.",
